Union fixture_crate::TestUnion — in fixture-crate (0.1.0)

A union for testing union formatting.

Demonstrates a union with public and private fields, a generic parameter, and an inherent method — the union counterpart to TestStruct.

union TestUnion<T: Copy> {
    pub as_int: u64,
    pub as_float: f64,
    private: T,
}

